{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54205","headline":"玉川偶兴 · 胡曾","name":"玉川偶兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉川鹤避卢仝啜，盘谷猿惊李愿归。\n兴尽携筇一回首，西风拂拂白云飞。\n（见乾隆二十四年刊萧应植纂《济源县志》卷十六。\n此诗疑僞。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}